## Third-party

### Pixel portrait sprites — CC BY 4.0

The character portraits are rendered from a sprite set that is the work of
**Viktor Hahn**, from https://github.com/V-ktor/pixel-art-portraits, licensed
under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The sprites are unmodified.

```
Pixel portrait sprites
  Viktor Hahn — github.com/V-ktor/pixel-art-portraits
  CC BY 4.0 — creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Unmodified.
```

They reach this project through @shieldsbetter/pixel-portraits, whose own code
is ISC; its sprite compositor is a re-implementation of upstream Godot code that
is MIT (© 2021 Viktor).
